---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; import DemoLabel from '../components/DemoLabel.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="HonorCart" description="Find coupons without overwriting the creator or publisher who sent you.">
<section class="hero shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Private beta · Monetization disabled</p><h1>Save money.<br/><em>Keep credit honest.</em></h1><p class="lead">HonorCart is a browser extension for finding coupons while protecting detected creator, publisher, and affiliate referrals.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/signup">Join the beta <span>→</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/transparency">Read our stand-down policy</a></div><p class="microcopy">Coupon lookup is user-initiated. Affiliate activation is disabled in the current release.</p></div><div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Example HonorCart extension state"><div class="browser-card"><div class="browser-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span><div>store.example / checkout</div></div><div class="checkout"><div class="checkout-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="extension-card"><div class="extension-head"><b class="mini-shield">✓</b><strong>HonorCart</strong><DemoLabel/></div><div class="success-icon">✓</div><h3>Referral protected</h3><p>You arrived through a creator link. HonorCart is standing down.</p><div class="referral-row"><span>Existing referral</span><strong>Kept intact</strong></div><button>Find coupons safely</button><small>HonorCart earns $0 on this session</small></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-strip"><div class="shell"><span>Our promise</span><p>If we detect an existing affiliate referral, HonorCart does not replace it.</p><a href="/transparency">See the full policy →</a></div></section>
<section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A different incentive</p><h2>The coupon should help the shopper — not erase the introduction.</h2></div><div class="three-grid"><article class="feature-card"><span class="number">01</span><div class="line-icon">↗</div><h3>Detect the referral</h3><p>HonorCart looks for supported affiliate signals when you arrive at a merchant.</p></article><article class="feature-card accent-card"><span class="number">02</span><div class="line-icon">♢</div><h3>Protect the credit</h3><p>When an existing referral is recognized, monetization is disabled for that session.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="number">03</span><div class="line-icon">✓</div><h3>Find savings safely</h3><p>Where supported, you can still test coupons without HonorCart taking attribution.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="shell narrow centered"><p class="eyebrow">For creators</p><h2>Reporting will start with real events.</h2><p class="lead-small max-copy">Creator reporting is not live yet. HonorCart will not publish referral, checkout, or commission figures until they come from real activity and their sources and limitations can be shown clearly.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/creators">See the creator plan →</a></div></section>
<section class="section shell centered"><p class="eyebrow">Trust is a product feature</p><h2>Our rules are public.</h2><p class="lead-small max-copy">We publish how referrals are recognized, when HonorCart stands down, what we measure, and where our visibility ends.</p><div class="policy-grid"><div><b>01</b><h3>Existing referrals come first</h3></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Monetization is server-controlled</h3></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Estimates are labeled</h3></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Policies are versioned</h3></div></div><a class="button dark" href="/transparency">Read the transparency standard</a></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="shell"><div><p class="eyebrow light">Early access</p><h2>Help us build the respectful coupon tool.</h2></div><a class="button light-button" href="/signup">Join the beta →</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
